## Third-party source material

Documents in the benchmark corpora are excerpts of US federal government works,
which are not subject to copyright in the United States (17 U.S.C. § 105). Each
document records its agency, source URL and the rights basis under which it is
included, and `corpus/sources.py` refuses to snapshot known non-federal content
served from federal domains. The CC BY 4.0 grant above applies to this
repository's own contributions — the selection, arrangement, annotation and
measurement — not to the underlying federal text, which is already free of
copyright.
